on exitFrame
  [  0] pushcons 0 .............................. <EMPTY>
  [  2] pushint8 3 .............................. <3>
  [  5] set 0 ................................... set the keyDownScript to EMPTY
  [  7] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [  9] extcall 0 ............................... stonecold()
  [ 11] ret
end
